<% content_for :meta_title, "Privacy Policy | Arqvexa" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Privacy Policy for Arqvexa — how we collect, use and protect your information when you contact us or use our website." %>
<% content_for :canonical_url, site_url(privacy_path) %>

<%= render "shared/navigation" %>

<main id="main-content" class="page-main">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Legal</div>
      <h1>Privacy <em>Policy.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Last updated: <%= Date.new(2026, 8, 30).strftime("%d %B %Y") %></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-prose">
      <p>Arqvexa ("we", "us", "our") operates the website at <%= request.base_url %>. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you visit our site or contact us about interior design or IT development services.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use our contact form, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name and email address</li>
        <li>Phone number (if provided)</li>
        <li>Service interest and message content</li>
        <li>Technical data such as IP address and browser type (via hosting and analytics providers)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use contact details to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to enquiries about interior design or IT projects</li>
        <li>Provide quotes, consultations and project updates</li>
        <li>Improve our website and services</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>Contact form delivery</h2>
      <p>Form submissions may be processed by third-party services (such as Web3Forms) to deliver messages to our email inbox. Those providers process data according to their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We may use cookies or analytics tools (such as Google Analytics) to understand how visitors use our site. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>We retain enquiry emails for as long as needed to respond to your request and manage any ongoing project relationship, unless you ask us to delete them sooner.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access, correction or deletion of your personal data by contacting us at <%= mail_to contact_email, contact_email %>.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Arqvexa</strong><br>
        Email: <%= mail_to contact_email, contact_email %><br>
        Phone / WhatsApp: <%= link_to contact_phone_display, "https://wa.me/919917639330", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" %><br>
        Service area: Delhi NCR &amp; remote (India)
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%= render "shared/footer" %>
